 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "Each sample is \"<time>:<f1->f2->...>\" with strictly increasing integer times; an empty stack is allowed. A frame instance at depth d continues from one sample to the next iff the stacks agree on positions 0..d (so recursion and re-entry are distinguished by position). Emit [\"start\", name, t] when a frame instance first appears at sample time t and [\"end\", name, t] at the sample time where it is first absent; at one time ends come first (innermost first) then starts (outermost first). Frames open after the last sample get no end event.",
  "provenance": [
   {
    "repository": "gamma",
